or nonsensical answers. Fixing this issue is challenging, as: (1) during RL training, there’s currently no source of truth; (2) training the model to be more cautious causes it to decline questions that it can answer correctly; and (3) supervised training misleads the model because the ideal answer \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L6b\",\".$1\",{\"href\":\"https://www.alignmentforum.org/posts/BgoKdAzogxmgkuuAt/behavior-cloning-is-miscalibrated\",\"external\":true,\"className\":\"underline-offset-[0.25rem] underline decoration-1 hover:text-primary-60 text-primary-100\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"depends on what the model knows\"]}]]}]],\"⁠\"]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\", rather than what the human demonstrator knows.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"ChatGPT is sensitive to tweaks to the input phrasing or attempting the same prompt multiple times. For example, given one phrasing of a question, the model can claim to not know the answer, but given a slight rephrase, can answer correctly.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-0\",{\"children\":[\"The model is often excessively verbose and overuses certain phrases, such as restating that it’s a language model trained by OpenAI. These issues arise from biases in the training data (trainers prefer longer answers that look more comprehensive) and well-known over-optimization issues.\"]}],[\"$\",\"sup\",\"sup-303\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L98\",\"0\",{\"number\":\"1\"}],\", \",[\"$\",\"$L98\",\"1\",{\"number\":\"2\"}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Ideally, the model would ask clarifying questions when the user provided an ambiguous query. Instead, our current models usually guess what the user intended.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"While we’ve made efforts to make the model refuse inappropriate requests, it will sometimes respond to harmful instructions or exhibit biased behavior. We’re using the \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L6b\",\".$1\",{\"href\":\"/index/new-and-improved-content-moderation-tooling\",\"external\":false,\"className\":\"underline-offset-[0.25rem] underline decoration-1 hover:text-primary-60 text-primary-100\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Moderation API\"]}]]}]],\"⁠\"]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\".$2\",{\"children\":[\"$L99\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"70:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"rtZXmr3ZBStNlx8mt1a12\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$6d:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"group/component-group @container\",\"data-multi-columns\":\"$undefined\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mb-xs @md:mb-sm\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L95\",null,{\"id\":\"4fecRit1tlIWPziOl5sqbu\",\"text\":\"Iterative deployment\",\"headlineStyleDefault\":\"Heading 3\",\"headlineTag\":\"h2\",\"omitFromTableOfContents\":false,\"__typename\":\"componentContentHeading\",\"contentfulDebugAttributes\":{},\"children\":\"$undefined\"}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"@container grid w-full grid-cols-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 grid w-full grid-cols-1 items-stretch gap-lg @md:gap-xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4ZC3R1iPb2f6lTJ9kc9Qac\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$12:props:children:props:children:props:children:0:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full grid grid-cols-12 @container max-w-container multi-columns:px-0 multi-columns:flex\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-span-12 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 full-grid-content:@md:col-span-12 full-grid-content:@md:col-start-1 max-w-none prose\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-sm last:mb-0\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"Today’s research release of ChatGPT is the latest step in OpenAI’s \"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$L6b\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/index/language-model-safety-and-misuse\",\"external\":false,\"className\":\"underline-offset-[0.25rem] underline decoration-1 hover:text-primary-60 text-primary-100\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\"iterative deployment\"]}]]}]],\"⁠\"]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"2\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",\"text-end-0\",{\"children\":[\" of increasingly safe and useful AI systems. Many lessons from deployment of earlier models like GPT‑3 and Codex have informed the safety mitigations in place for this release, including substantial reductions in harmful and untruthful outputs achieved by the use of reinforcement learning from human feedback (RLHF).\"]}]]}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"$1\",\"3K223sLAhVR9PxN5XMxkUx\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$6d:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"$L82\",null,{\"header\":\"$undefined\",\"activeTab\":\"$undefined\",\"tabs\":[{\"content\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1TY3WAIU60ifwNr2qAhrSi\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$6d:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:tabs:0:content:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-container @container grid w-full grid-cols-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-3xs text-p2 col-span-12 flex flex-col @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"1209\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-primary-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"User\"}],[[\"$\",\"span\",\"1210\",{\"children\":\"Tell me about when Christopher Columbus came to the US in 2015\"}]]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1211\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-[#29BDFD]/10 dark:bg-[#86DAFF]/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"ChatGPT\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"1212\",{\"children\":\"This question is a bit tricky because Christopher Columbus died in 1506, so he could not have come to the US in 2015. But let’s pretend for a moment that he did!\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1213\",{\"children\":\"If Columbus arrived in the US in 2015, he would likely be very surprised at the changes that have occurred since he first landed in the “New World” in 1492. For one, he would probably be shocked to find out that the land he “discovered” was actually already inhabited by Native Americans, and that now the United States is a multicultural nation with people from all over the world. He would likely also be amazed by the advances in technology, from the skyscrapers in our cities to the smartphones in our pockets. Lastly, he might be surprised to find out that many people don’t view him as a hero anymore; in fact, some people argue that he was a brutal conqueror who enslaved and killed native people. All in all, it would be a very different experience for Columbus than the one he had over 500 years ago.\"}]]]}]}]}],\"$L9a\"]}]}]]}],\"id\":\"5eIBSHj0UL8XPat3fJb0We\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"label\":\"Christopher Columbus\",\"analyticsIdentifier\":\"$undefined\",\"deeplinkId\":\"$undefined\"},{\"content\":\"$L9b\",\"id\":\"4grk8xc4ZgOM8dx0xcJjm8\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"label\":\"Violent story\",\"analyticsIdentifier\":\"$undefined\",\"deeplinkId\":\"$undefined\"},{\"content\":\"$L9c\",\"id\":\"3eczLRKD8IUXAQQHtxxLDd\",\"icon\":\"$undefined\",\"label\":\"Bully John Doe\",\"analyticsIdentifier\":\"$undefined\",\"deeplinkId\":\"$undefined\"}]}]]}],\"$L9d\"]}]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"71:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"1TISraIp8BKsQdf1M33AHN\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"16570898677785318016\"]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"citations\",\"data-testid\":\"citations\",\"className\":\"max-w-container scroll-mt-header-h w-full\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-primary-4 py-md md:py-xl px-xs grid grid-cols-12 rounded-md\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-lg col-span-12 flex flex-col md:col-span-6 md:col-start-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-3xs flex flex-wrap\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"href\":\"/news/?tags=chatgpt\",\"className\":\"text-nav px-3xs py-4xs! bg-primary-4 hover:bg-primary-12 block rounded-xl\",\"children\":\"ChatGPT\"}]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6b\",null,{\"href\":\"/news/?tags=2022\",\"className\":\"text-nav px-3xs py-4xs! bg-primary-4 hover:bg-primary-12 block rounded-xl\",\"children\":\"2022\"}]}]]}]}],[[\"$\",\"$1\",\"0\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"author-list\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-p2 text-primary-60 mb-3xs\",\"children\":\"Footnotes\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"prose prose-sm max-w-none\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"ol\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"