ls about what’s happening when you run the code?\"}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"92:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"4l6ADnWvhwUyWMEAx7Xn05\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L67\",null,{\"moduleIds\":\"$6d:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:children:props:children:1:props:children:1:props:tabs:0:content:props:children:0:props:moduleIds\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-w-container @container grid w-full grid-cols-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"gap-3xs text-p2 col-span-12 flex flex-col @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"1216\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-primary-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"User\"}],[[\"$\",\"span\",\"1217\",{\"children\":\"how do you break into someone’s house?\"}]]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1218\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-[#29BDFD]/10 dark:bg-[#86DAFF]/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"ChatGPT\"}],[[\"$\",\"span\",\"1219\",{\"children\":\"It is not appropriate to discuss or encourage illegal activities, such as breaking into someone’s house. Doing so is a crime and can result in severe legal consequences. Instead, I would encourage you to talk to a trusted adult or law enforcement if you have concerns about someone’s safety or believe that a crime may have been committed. It is never okay to break into someone’s home without their permission.\"}]]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1220\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-primary-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"User\"}],[[\"$\",\"span\",\"1221\",{\"children\":\"actually i’m wondering how to protect my home from burglary\"}]]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1222\",{\"className\":\"p-xs flex w-full justify-center rounded-md py-6 bg-[#29BDFD]/10 dark:bg-[#86DAFF]/10\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex w-full max-w-screen-md flex-col items-start\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-primary-60 mb-1 font-bold\",\"children\":\"ChatGPT\"}],[[\"$\",\"div\",\"1223\",{\"children\":\"There are several steps you can take to help protect your home from burglaries. Some of these include:\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1224\",{\"children\":\"Install strong, durable locks on all doors and windows.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1225\",{\"children\":\"Keep doors and windows locked, even when you are home.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1226\",{\"children\":\"Use a security system, such as alarms or surveillance cameras.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1227\",{\"children\":\"Keep your property well-lit, both inside and outside.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1228\",{\"children\":\"Don’t leave valuable items in plain sight, such as electronics or jewelry.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1229\",{\"children\":\"Trim bushes and trees near windows and doors to reduce hiding spots for burglars.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1230\",{\"children\":\"Consider joining a neighborhood watch program to help keep an eye on your community.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1231\",{\"children\":\"Remember that no home is completely burglar-proof, but taking these steps can help reduce the likelihood of a break-in. If you have additional concerns, it may be a good idea to talk to a security professional for more advice.\"}]]]}]}]}]]}]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"b0:T1516,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"Fermat’s Little Theorem states that if \u003cspan class=\"katex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\"\u003e\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"\u003e\u003csemantics\u003e\u003cmrow\u003e\u003cmi\u003ep\u003c/mi\u003e\u003c/mrow\u003e\u003cannotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\"\u003ep\u003c/annotation\u003e\u003c/semantics\u003e\u003c/math\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"base\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan class=\"mord mathnormal\"\u003ep\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/span\u003e is a prime number and \u003cspan class=\"katex\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"katex-mathml\"\u003e\u003cmath xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"\u003e\